WEBVTT

00:03:28.371 --> 00:03:30.581
So therefore, in this scenario,

00:03:30.623 --> 00:03:34.168
time, therefore cost,

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.045
is fixed,

00:03:36.087 --> 00:03:38.506
and learning is variable.

00:03:41.676 --> 00:03:45.346
This really makes it problematic
to drive down cost,

00:03:45.388 --> 00:03:47.723
and it particularly becomes problematic

00:03:47.765 --> 00:03:53.145
if you’re trying to balance school,
work and other family obligations,

00:03:53.187 --> 00:03:56.232
as well as other obligations
and responsibilities.

00:03:57.316 --> 00:04:00.861
But if we are to flip that scenario,